  * PACKAGING: Now supports Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble) only
  * PACKAGING: Dropped Ubuntu 22.04 (Jammy) support - rustc 1.58 too old for dependencies
  * PACKAGING: Dropped Ubuntu 20.04 (Focal) support - rustc 1.41 too old
  * PACKAGING: Fixed invalid Rust edition (2021, not 2025)
  * PACKAGING: Fixed PPA build system for multi-distribution uploads
  * PACKAGING: Corrected orig.tar.xz handling to prevent checksum conflicts
  * PACKAGING: Build script now properly reuses upstream tarball across distributions
  * PACKAGING: Added Cargo.lock for reproducible builds

